<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Things That Make You YOU 🎀</title>

<style>

*{
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}

body{
margin:0;
min-height:100vh;
overflow-x:hidden;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffeaf5,#fff5d8,#e8f8ff);
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
padding:20px;
}


/* Floating blobs */

.blob{
position:fixed;
border-radius:50%;
filter:blur(40px);
opacity:.35;
z-index:-1;
animation:float 8s infinite alternate;
}

.b1{
width:250px;
height:250px;
background:#ff8fc7;
top:-80px;
left:-80px;
}

.b2{
width:220px;
height:220px;
background:#ffd86b;
right:-70px;
top:200px;
}

.b3{
width:250px;
height:250px;
background:#8edcff;
bottom:-80px;
left:100px;
}


@keyframes float{
from{
transform:translateY(0);
}
to{
transform:translateY(40px);
}
}


/* Main card */

.card{

width:min(95vw,500px);
background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
border-radius:35px;
padding:25px;

box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.15);

animation:show .8s ease;

}


@keyframes show{
from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateY(50px);
}
to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);
}
}


h1{
text-align:center;
color:#ff4f87;
}


.intro{
text-align:center;
color:#666;
line-height:1.7;
}


/* Boxes */

.box{

padding:18px;
border-radius:22px;
margin:18px 0;
text-align:left;

animation:slide .8s ease both;

box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);

}


.box:nth-child(odd){
animation-delay:.2s;
}

.box:hover{
transform:translateY(-5px);
transition:.3s;
}


@keyframes slide{

from{
opacity:0;
transform:translateX(-40px);
}

to{
opacity:1;
transform:translateX(0);
}

}


.care{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe8f3,#fff);
}

.qt{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff8d8,#fff);
}

.attitude{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e7f8ff,#fff);
}

.ishan{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff1d8,#fff);
}

.encourage{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e9ffe8,#fff);
}

.award{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3e8ff,#fff);
text-align:center;
}



.award span{
font-size:34px;
font-weight:bold;
letter-spacing:3px;
color:#ff4f87;
}


/* Button */

button{

padding:15px 40px;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;

background:#111;
color:white;

font-size:18px;
font-weight:bold;

cursor:pointer;

box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.3);

animation:pulse 2s infinite;

}


button:hover{

transform:scale(1.08);

}


@keyframes pulse{

50%{
transform:scale(1.06);
}

}


/* Floating emojis */

.flower{

position:fixed;
bottom:-50px;

animation:rise linear infinite;

pointer-events:none;

}


@keyframes rise{

from{
transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
opacity:1;
}

to{
transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
opacity:0;
}

}


/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:600px){

.card{
padding:18px;
border-radius:25px;
}

h1{
font-size:25px;
}

.box{
padding:15px;
}

.award span{
font-size:27px;
}

button{
width:90%;
}

}

</style>

</head>


<body>


<div class="blob b1"></div>
<div class="blob b2"></div>
<div class="blob b3"></div>


<div class="card">


<h1>🎀 Things That Make You... YOU! 🎀</h1>


<p class="intro">
These are just a few things that make you special and unforgettable. 🌸💖
<br>
(And yes... a little friendly roasting too 😂)
</p>



<div class="box care">
<h3>💛 Caring 🎀</h3>

<p>
You always act like you don't care... 🤨
<br><br>
But deep down, you notice every little thing and care more than you admit. 🌼💖
</p>

</div>



<div class="box qt">

<h3>🧸 QT 🎀</h3>

<p>
No arguments allowed 😂
<br><br>
Your random expressions, innocent face and cute reactions deserve this title. 🌸✨
</p>

</div>



<div class="box attitude">

<h3>😎 Attitude Wali 🎀</h3>

<p>
Sometimes the attitude reaches the sky... ☁😂
<br><br>
But somehow it suits you perfectly. Stay confident and keep shining. ✨
</p>

</div>



<div class="box ishan">

<h3>😂 Ishan Paglu 🎀</h3>

<p>

Whenever the name <b>Ishan</b> appears...

<br><br>

Someone suddenly becomes a little more interested 👀😂

<br><br>

I'm not saying anything...

The evidence speaks for itself 🤣🌸

</p>

</div>



<div class="box encourage">

<h3>🚀 Encouraging 🎀</h3>

<p>

You probably don't even realize it...

<br><br>

But your words can cheer people up more than you think. 🌼💛

<br><br>

Never stop being that person. 💖

</p>

</div>



<div class="box award">

<h2>🏆 Today's Award 🎀</h2>

<p>
<span>DE-MODI-VATED</span>
</p>


<p>
🤣 No explanation needed.
<br>
The name says it all. 🌸🎀
</p>

<i>
*Warning: May remain DE-MODI-VATED until further notice.* 😂💜
</i>

</div>



<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:25px">

<button onclick="location.href='page5.html'">
🎀 Next Page ➜ 🎀
</button>

</div>


</div>



<script>


let emoji=[
"🎀","🌸","🌼","✨",
"💛","🦋","🌺","🌷","💖"
];


for(let i=0;i<45;i++){

let e=document.createElement("div");

e.className="flower";

e.innerHTML=emoji[Math.floor(Math.random()*emoji.length)];

e.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

e.style.fontSize=(18+Math.random()*20)+"px";

e.style.animationDuration=(5+Math.random()*7)+"s";


document.body.appendChild(e);

}


</script>


</body>
</html>